179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In this edition of Bird Watch, we decided to take a different approach. While we enjoy showcasing the progress our sections make, it doesn't fully capture the breadth of work our team undertakes. This time, we want to highlight some of our most exciting projects that drive our mission forward.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
