/ActualText (What is Lifeline?)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our team has been working tirelessly on Project Lifeline, a unique multidisciplinary project that involves both aerostructure & avionics members. The project aims to develop and refine a payload deployment system that would transport a payload box, filled with essential medical supplies, safely from our humanitarian drone, the Albatross, to an injured person on the ground.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
