194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The development and implementation of our payload deployment system within the Albatross can demonstrate to many drone companies that drones can be used in many first aid and emergency situations, rather than just for military prowess and recreational activities. This will push the incentives to develop more humanitarian drones and deliver more first-aid payloads to people in need.)
/E (The development and implementation of our payload deployment system within the Albatross can demonstrate to many drone companies that drones can be used in many first aid and emergency situations, rather than just for military prowess and recreational activities. This will push the incentives to develop more humanitarian drones and deliver more first-aid payloads to people in need.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
