/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The payload deployment system is designed to fit within the compact space of the Albatross and its software is designed to be integrated with Mission Management control panel. Pairing with the latest vision system, the team aims to detect a person on the ground and trigger a signal to our deployment system, which initiates the payload winching sequence.)
/E (The payload deployment system is designed to fit within the compact space of the Albatross and its software is designed to be integrated with Mission Management control panel. Pairing with the latest vision system, the team aims to detect a person on the ground and trigger a signal to our deployment system, which initiates the payload winching sequence.)
