/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The payload would be first be released to freefall. Once the payload reached a certain distance above the ground, the brake mechanism would immediately actuate and slow the payload down. After the cables attached to the payload have been detached and the payload has been released onto the ground, the system would winch the cable back up into the Albatross, completing the sequence.)
/E (The payload would be first be released to freefall. Once the payload reached a certain distance above the ground, the brake mechanism would immediately actuate and slow the payload down. After the cables attached to the payload have been detached and the payload has been released onto the ground, the system would winch the cable back up into the Albatross, completing the sequence.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
