/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (What is Peregrine? We are excited to introduce our latest innovation: a scale model of our fixed-wing drone, designed specifically to test and refine the key features and technologies that will be integral to our final aircraft. This 2.3m wingspan prototype, representing two-thirds the size of the planned full-scale version, is a pivotal part of our development process. It serves as a crucial testing ground for aerodynamic efficiency, control systems, and overall design, providing invaluable insights that will guide the final iteration of the drone. The scale model's development marks a significant milestone in our journey, showcasing our commitment to precision engineering and innovative design.)
/E (What is Peregrine? We are excited to introduce our latest innovation: a scale model of our fixed-wing drone, designed specifically to test and refine the key features and technologies that will be integral to our final aircraft. This 2.3m wingspan prototype, representing two-thirds the size of the planned full-scale version, is a pivotal part of our development process. It serves as a crucial testing ground for aerodynamic efficiency, control systems, and overall design, providing invaluable insights that will guide the final iteration of the drone. The scale model's development marks a significant milestone in our journey, showcasing our commitment to precision engineering and innovative design.)
